//
// Result: [ ] No new app registrations or service principal creation with a fast-follow credential/owner change detected
//         [ ] Results found — see findings below
//
// Findings:
//   Initiating account:
//   App name / AppId:
//   Follow-up change (credential/owner) and gap:
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
//
// Conclusion:
//   [ ] No suspicious activity identified — app registration confirmed as legitimate development/integration work
//   [ ] Suspicious activity identified — escalating
//   [ ] False positive — reason:
//
